        "background": "gray",
        "content": "<div style=\"width: 100%; height: 46.1458vw; background: #f9fcff; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n  <div style=\"height: 1.6667vw; font-size: 1.5625vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-BOLD; font-weight: 700; color: #182b44; position: absolute; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); top: 3.125vw;\">企业发展历程</div>\n  <div style=\"height: 0.7292vw; font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; position: absolute; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); top: 6.1979vw; white-space: nowrap;\">古河云重要发展历程和里程碑</div>\n  <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100.0vw; height: 100%; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 8.3333vw; top: 10.4167vw; width: 12.9167vw; height: 13.125vw; background: linear-gradient(209deg, #f4f9ff 0%, #ffffff 100%); box-shadow: 0px 0px 22px 0px rgba(3, 9, 26, 0.06); border: 1px solid #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0.625vw 18px; padding-right: 0.5208vw; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">11月古河云科技有限公司成立</div><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -10px; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 0.5208vw solid #fff; border-right: 0.5208vw solid transparent; border-left: 0.5208vw solid transparent;\"></div></div><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 27.5vw; top: 10.4167vw; width: 12.9167vw; height: 13.125vw; background: linear-gradient(209deg, #f4f9ff 0%, #ffffff 100%); box-shadow: 0px 0px 22px 0px rgba(3, 9, 26, 0.06); border: 1px solid #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0.625vw 18px; padding-right: 0.5208vw; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">1月 认定为 “新经济梯度培育企业</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">2月 获得“中小型科技企业”荣誉称号</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">3月 获得四川省高新技术企业称号</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">4月 获得资本市场千万级A轮融资</div><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -10px; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 0.5208vw solid #fff; border-right: 0.5208vw solid transparent; border-left: 0.5208vw solid transparent;\"></div></div><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 46.0417vw; top: 10.4167vw; width: 12.9167vw; height: 13.125vw; background: linear-gradient(209deg, #f4f9ff 0%, #ffffff 100%); box-shadow: 0px 0px 22px 0px rgba(3, 9, 26, 0.06); border: 1px solid #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0.625vw 18px; padding-right: 0.5208vw; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">1月 获得疫情防控优秀企业称号</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">2月 获得AAA级信用企业证书、AAA级重合同守信用企业证书</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">3月 古河云高新研发中心正式揭牌</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">4月 入选成都“规上企业”名单</div><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -10px; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 0.5208vw solid #fff; border-right: 0.5208vw solid transparent; border-left: 0.5208vw solid transparent;\"></div></div><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 64.3229vw; top: 10.4167vw; width: 12.9167vw; height: 13.125vw; background: linear-gradient(209deg, #f4f9ff 0%, #ffffff 100%); box-shadow: 0px 0px 22px 0px rgba(3, 9, 26, 0.06); border: 1px solid #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0.625vw 18px; padding-right: 0.5208vw; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">1月 获得发明专利【一种通过分布 式架构访问三维模型的方法】</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">2月 获得2022年度四川省最具核心 竞争力软件企业、2022年度四川省 优秀软件产品</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">3月“开河”多场景应用平台获得成 都市“2022年城市示范应用场景项目”三等奖（无一、二等奖）</div><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -10px; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 0.5208vw solid #fff; border-right: 0.5208vw solid transparent; border-left: 0.5208vw solid transparent;\"></div></div><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 83.0729vw; top: 10.4167vw; width: 12.9167vw; height: 13.125vw; background: linear-gradient(209deg, #f4f9ff 0%, #ffffff 100%); box-shadow: 0px 0px 22px 0px rgba(3, 9, 26, 0.06); border: 1px solid #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0.625vw 18px; paddin