8vw; word-break: break-all;\">2月 电子科大研究生就业实践基地授牌</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">3月 通过2022年度四川省“专 精特新”中小企业认定</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">4月 公司8名研发人员获得“20 22年成都市软件资深工程师” 荣誉称号</div><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -10px; transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(180deg); width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 0.5208vw solid #fff; border-right: 0.5208vw solid transparent; border-left: 0.5208vw solid transparent;\"></div></div><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 74.4792vw; top: 28.6458vw; width: 12.9167vw; height: 13.125vw; background: linear-gradient(383deg, #f4f9ff 0%, #ffffff 100%); box-shadow: 0px 0px 22px 0px rgba(3, 9, 26, 0.06); border: 1px solid #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0.625vw 18px; padding-right: 0.5208vw; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">1月 获得发明专利【三维模型视觉穿透方法、系统、电子设备、及存储设备】</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">3月 荣获成都市温江区数字经济产业联盟第一届副理事长单位</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: break-all;\">9月 软件著作权--数字孪生管理平台V1.0</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.7292vw; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR; font-weight: 400; color: #585c60; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 0.5208vw; word-break: b